            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Tirana_-_Skanderbeg_Square_%28Sheshi_Sk%C3%ABnderbej%29_-_by_Pudelek.jpg/1280px-Tirana_-_Skanderbeg_Square_%28Sheshi_Sk%C3%ABnderbej%29_-_by_Pudelek.jpg",
