            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Pyramid_of_Tirana_October_2023.jpg/1280px-Pyramid_of_Tirana_October_2023.jpg",
            "file": "Pyramid of Tirana October 2023.jpg",
