            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Genocide_Memorial_complex_from_air_on_a_sunny_day%2C_September_2017.jpg/1280px-Genocide_Memorial_complex_from_air_on_a_sunny_day%2C_September_2017.jpg",
