                "en": "Oranjestad, the capital and most populous of Aruba's eight regions, is located on the southwestern coast of the island. Administratively, the Oranjestad is divided into two regions: East and West. In 2010, the capital had a population of 28,294, and by 2020, it increased to 28,658."
