            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/%D0%A7%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%82%D0%B5_%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B4%D1%87%D0%B8%D1%88%D0%BA%D0%B8_%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B8_-_%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B4%D1%87%D0%B8%D0%BA.jpg/1280px-%D0%A7%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%82%D0%B5_%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B4%D1%87%D0%B8%D1%88%D0%BA%D0%B8_%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B8_-_%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B4%D1%87%D0%B8%D0%BA.jpg",
