            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/92/Athabasca_Glacier_from_the_valley_floor%2C_Jasper_National_Park%2C_Alberta%2C_Canada.jpg/1280px-Athabasca_Glacier_from_the_valley_floor%2C_Jasper_National_Park%2C_Alberta%2C_Canada.jpg",
            "file": "Athabasca Glacier from the valley floor, Jasper National Park, Alberta, Canada.jpg",
