            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Castillo_de_Praga%2C_Praga%2C_Rep%C3%BAblica_Checa%2C_2022-07-02%2C_DD_209.jpg/1280px-Castillo_de_Praga%2C_Praga%2C_Rep%C3%BAblica_Checa%2C_2022-07-02%2C_DD_209.jpg",
