            "fame": 20,
            "description": {
                "fr": "La ville coloniale, appelée aussi Ciudad Colonial est le cœur historique de la ville de Saint-Domingue, capitale de la République dominicaine. Ce quartier, constituant l'un des 70 secteurs du Distrito Nacional, a été inscrit au répertoire du patrimoine mondial de l'UNESCO.",
                "en": "Ciudad Colonial is the historic central neighborhood of the Dominican Republic's capital Santo Domingo. It is the oldest continuously inhabited European-established settlement in the Americas. The area has been declared a World Heritage Site by UNESCO. It is also known as Zona Colonial or more colloquially as \"La Zona\"."
            }
