            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/71/London_-_London_Tower_Bridge_-_140806_171049.jpg/1280px-London_-_London_Tower_Bridge_-_140806_171049.jpg",
            "file": "London - London Tower Bridge - 140806 171049.jpg",
            "author": "Barcex",
