                "en": "The Kwame Nkrumah Memorial Park and Mausoleum is located in downtown Accra, the capital of Ghana. The mausoleum, originally designed by Dr. E. G. A. Don Arthur, is the centerpiece of the Kwame Nkrumah Memorial Park and houses the final remains of the first President and his wife, Fathia Nkrumah."
