                "fr": "Le Hong Kong Disneyland Hotel est l'hôtel de luxe du complexe de Hong Kong Disneyland Resort. Il se situe au bout de la promenade construite par Disney sur l'île de Lantau en bordure de la baie de Hong Kong. L'hôtel compte 400 chambres et suites.",
                "en": "Hong Kong Disneyland Hotel is the second Disney hotel in the Hong Kong Disneyland Resort in Penny's Bay, Lantau Island, Hong Kong. The theme of the hotel is of a Victorian style, and is located near Disneyland Harbour. The hotel is built on reclaimed land and opened on 12 September 2005. The hotel has 400 guestrooms and a convention centre with ballrooms and function rooms. The Convention Centre offers three ballrooms. It is in the Islands District."
