            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/34/ISS022-E-39042_-_View_of_the_Lesser_Antilles.jpg/1280px-ISS022-E-39042_-_View_of_the_Lesser_Antilles.jpg",
            "file": "ISS022-E-39042 - View of the Lesser Antilles.jpg",
