            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Vilnius_-_Cathedral_01.jpg/1280px-Vilnius_-_Cathedral_01.jpg",
            "file": "Vilnius - Cathedral 01.jpg",
