            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Gedimino_pilis_by_Augustas_Didzgalvis.jpg/1280px-Gedimino_pilis_by_Augustas_Didzgalvis.jpg",
            "file": "Gedimino pilis by Augustas Didzgalvis.jpg",
