            "fame": 21,
            "description": {
                "fr": "Le château de Vianden est un château fort situé dans la ville de Vianden, au nord-est du Luxembourg. Il fait partie du parc naturel germano-luxembourgeois.",
                "en": "Vianden Castle, located in Vianden in the north of Luxembourg, is one of the largest fortified castles west of the Rhine. With origins dating from the fourth century as a Roman outpost and the 10th century, the more familiar castle form was built in the Romanesque style from the 11th to 14th centuries. Gothic transformations and trimmings were added at the end of this period."
            }
