                "fr": "L'atoll de Jaluit est un atoll constitué par 91 îlots dans les Îles Marshall dont il est un district législatif.",
                "en": "Jaluit Atoll is a large coral atoll of 91 islands in the Pacific Ocean and forms a legislative district of the Ralik Chain of the Republic of the Marshall Islands. Its total land area is 11.34 square kilometers, and it encloses a lagoon with an area of 690 square kilometers. Most of the land area is on the largest islet of Jaluit. Jaluit is approximately 220 kilometers southwest of Majuro. Jaluit Atoll is a designated conservation area and Ramsar Wetland."
