                "fr": "Le Montserrat Volcano Observatory est un observatoire volcanologique situé sur l'île caribéenne de Montserrat, où la Soufrière est en éruption depuis 1995. Le personnel du MVO décrit ses activités comme visant à réduire l'impact de l'activité volcanique par la surveillance, la recherche, l'éducation et le conseil.",
                "en": "The Montserrat Volcano Observatory is a volcano observatory which is located on the Caribbean island of Montserrat, where the Soufrière Hills volcano has been actively erupting since 1995. The MVO staff describe their activities as working to reduce the impact of volcanic activity by monitoring, researching, educating, and advising. The MVO building is situated in the village of Flemmings, near Salem in the parish of St. Peter, in the west of the island."
