            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Caminhos_de_Ferro_de_Mocambique%2C_Railway_Station_in_Maputo%2C_Mozambique.jpg/1280px-Caminhos_de_Ferro_de_Mocambique%2C_Railway_Station_in_Maputo%2C_Mozambique.jpg",
