            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/13/Arecibo_radio_telescope_SJU_06_2019_6144.jpg/1280px-Arecibo_radio_telescope_SJU_06_2019_6144.jpg",
            "file": "Arecibo radio telescope SJU 06 2019 6144.jpg",
