            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/Jerusalem-2013-Temple_Mount-Al-Aqsa_Mosque_%28NE_exposure%29.jpg/1280px-Jerusalem-2013-Temple_Mount-Al-Aqsa_Mosque_%28NE_exposure%29.jpg",
