            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/16-04-04-Felsendom-Tempelberg-Jerusalem-RalfR-WAT_6385.jpg/1280px-16-04-04-Felsendom-Tempelberg-Jerusalem-RalfR-WAT_6385.jpg",
