            "fame": 32,
            "description": {
                "fr": "Le Padrão dos Descobrimentos est un imposant monument portugais situé dans le quartier de Belém à Lisbonne, sur la rive droite septentrionale du Tage. Il fut érigé en 1960 à la mémoire du prince Henri le Navigateur et des navigateurs et grandes figures de l’expansion coloniale portugaise des XVe et XVIe siècles.",
                "en": "The Monument of the Discoveries is a monument on the northern bank of the Tagus River estuary, in the civil parish of Santa Maria de Belém, Lisbon. Located along the river where ships departed to explore and trade with India and the Orient, the monument celebrates the Portuguese Age of Discovery during the 15th and 16th centuries."
            }
