            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Drone_shots_of_the_Kakum_Nationa_Park_03.jpg/1280px-Drone_shots_of_the_Kakum_Nationa_Park_03.jpg",
            "file": "Drone shots of the Kakum Nationa Park 03.jpg",
