                "fr": "Le palais royal de Stockholm est un palais royal situé sur le Norrström, dans la partie nord de Gamla stan de Stockholm, en Suède. Il s'agit de la résidence officielle des monarques de Suède.",
                "en": "Stockholm Palace, or the Royal Palace, is the official residence and major royal palace of the Swedish monarch. Stockholm Palace is in Stadsholmen, in Gamla stan in the capital, Stockholm. It neighbours the Riksdag building. The offices of the King, the other members of the Swedish royal family, and the Royal Court of Sweden are here. The palace is used for representative purposes by the King whilst performing his duties as the head of state."
