            "fame": 15,
            "description": {
                "fr": "Le palais présidentiel du Suriname est le palais présidentiel de la république du Suriname. Il est situé dans la capitale, Paramaribo, faisant face à la Place de l'Indépendance, qui est également adjacente à l'Assemblée nationale du Suriname, au bâtiment du Congrès, à la Cour de justice et au ministère des Finances.",
                "en": "The Presidential Palace of Suriname is the presidential palace of Suriname in the capital of Paramaribo. It is located across from The Independence Square, which also houses the National Assembly of Suriname, the Congress building, the Court of Justice, and the Ministry of Finance. It is one of the most prolific and best maintained examples of Dutch colonial architecture in Suriname and is part of the UNESCO world Heritage site of the Paramaribo inner-city. The Garden of Palms is located behind it."
            }
