            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e1/Bosra%2C_Daraa%2C_Syria%2C_Citadel_of_Bosra%2C_Walls.jpg/1280px-Bosra%2C_Daraa%2C_Syria%2C_Citadel_of_Bosra%2C_Walls.jpg",
