            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Air_Force_Hercules_-_Flickr_-_NZ_Defence_Force.jpg/1280px-Air_Force_Hercules_-_Flickr_-_NZ_Defence_Force.jpg",
            "file": "Air Force Hercules - Flickr - NZ Defence Force.jpg",
