            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Olduvai-Schlucht_Mike_Kr%C3%BCger_110126_1.jpg/1280px-Olduvai-Schlucht_Mike_Kr%C3%BCger_110126_1.jpg",
