            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/54/%C3%85land_Maritime_Museum%2C_2019_%2801%29.jpg/1280px-%C3%85land_Maritime_Museum%2C_2019_%2801%29.jpg",
            "file": "Åland Maritime Museum, 2019 (01).jpg",
