            "image": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Sukur_Cultural_Landscape_%283%29.jpg/1280px-Sukur_Cultural_Landscape_%283%29.jpg",
            "file": "Sukur Cultural Landscape (3).jpg",
