            "fame": 42,
            "description": {
                "fr": "Giethoorn est un village néerlandais situé dans la commune de Steenwijkerland, en province d'Overijssel, à proximité du parc national Weerribben-Wieden. Comptant 2 765 habitants lors du recensement de 2019, il attire chaque année plusieurs centaines de milliers de touristes par son image de campagne néerlandaise.",
                "en": "Giethoorn is a village in the province of Overijssel, Netherlands, with a population of 2,795 in 2020. It is located in the municipality of Steenwijkerland, about 5 km southwest of Steenwijk. As a popular Dutch tourist destination both within the Netherlands and abroad, Giethoorn is often referred to as \"Dutch Venice\" or the \"Venice of the Netherlands\"."
            }
